sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant UI as ConsentPanel UI
    participant Hook as useUpdateConsentMutation
    participant API as POST /api/v1/consents
    participant Ledger as consents Table

    User->>UI: Toggle "Facial Biometric Processing" (ON)
    UI->>Hook: Mutate { scope: 'FACIAL_BIOMETRIC_PROCESSING', status: 'GRANTED' }
    Hook->>API: HTTP POST /api/v1/consents
    API->>Ledger: INSERT INTO consents (user_id, scope, status, policy_version)
    Ledger-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>Hook: Return Updated Consent Object
    Hook->>UI: Show Subtle Green Toast: "Consent Preferences Updated"
